The source data for the copy is from `this + imageOffsetsZ[old_gid] + 8` to `this + imageOffsetsZ[old_gid] + 8 + (delta - 8)` = `this + imageOffsetsZ[old_gid] + delta` = `this + imageOffsetsZ[old_gid + 1]`.

